# Stormpike Battle Charger for Exalted Stormpike Guard (Era rule; the reputation
# comes from Alterac Valley, one of Forever's four battlegrounds).
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 tables via wago.tools (ItemSparse: level
# 60, 200g, no riding rank asked); items.json / npcs.json for the vendors.

step Stormpike Guard
  tip Alterac Valley (level 51+) raises Stormpike Guard: win, capture towers and graveyards, and hand in the battleground's turn-ins. Thanthaldis Snowgleam waits outside the battleground on the Alterac Mountains border above Hillsbrad; Gaelden Hammersmith inside Alterac Valley sells the same mount.
  rep "Stormpike Guard" Exalted

step Stormpike Battle Charger
  tip The Forever client lists it at 200g and level 60, and asks for no riding rank.
  level 60
  buy 19030 npc 13217                 -- Thanthaldis Snowgleam, 200g
